426 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 186 0 R
/T (Selection Sort splits the array into a sorted and an unsorted part. Each pass scans the unsorted part for the minimum and swaps it into the boundary position, growing the sorted part by one)
/E (Selection Sort splits the array into a sorted and an unsorted part. Each pass scans the unsorted part for the minimum and swaps it into the boundary position, growing the sorted part by one)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [11]
>>
